[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5808654093","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123510#issuecomment-5808654093","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123510","id":5808654093,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWjkHDQ","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T06:04:19Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T06:04:19Z","body":"You can't assign untyped dictionaries to a variable which expects a typed dictionary. So I don't really see anything that looks wrong to me here.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5808654093/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5808752049","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123510#issuecomment-5808752049","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123510","id":5808752049,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWjqFsQ","user":{"login":"ashmys","id":103937907,"node_id":"U_kgDOBjH3cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103937907?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys","html_url":"https://github.com/ashmys","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T06:12:41Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T06:12:41Z","body":"well, we can do it normally, so i thought we might as well able to do it with RefCounted on Autoload var.\n\n```gdscript\n\tvar some_data: Dictionary[StringName, String] = {}\n\tsome_data = {}\n\tprint(some_data)\n```\n\nOutput:\n```\n{  }\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5808752049/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5808953322","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123510#issuecomment-5808953322","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123510","id":5808953322,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWj2X6g","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T06:28:36Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T06:28:36Z","body":"Literals do produce typed collections if we are able to deduce it from the context. So here the literal does create a correctly typed dictionary. But if you assign it to `local_data: Dictionary` you are creating an untyped one.\n\nWe can't emit a compile time error about this, because variables typed using untyped dicts are allowed to contain typed dict values, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15546 for more details.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5808953322/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5809092672","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123510#issuecomment-5809092672","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123510","id":5809092672,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWj-4QA","user":{"login":"ashmys","id":103937907,"node_id":"U_kgDOBjH3cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103937907?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys","html_url":"https://github.com/ashmys","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T06:39:15Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T06:39:15Z","body":"Ooh, alright then.\nWhat do you think i should do about this issue?\nDo i need to close it?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5809092672/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5812339200","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123510#issuecomment-5812339200","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123510","id":5812339200,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWnFCAA","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T10:25:30Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T10:25:30Z","body":"If you have only one type you can workaround this by using cast `dict_or_default(data, &\"data\", {} as Dictionary[StringName, int])`. With it it can also deduce the type from the context. Also don't use casts with typed containers in other situations.\n\nIf the place is not performance sensitive you can also call duplicate on some typed container and clear the duplicated copy, it will duplicate the type.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5812339200/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5816590784","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123510#issuecomment-5816590784","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123510","id":5816590784,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWrIhwA","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T14:58:36Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T14:58:36Z","body":"In terms of future proofing, you'll probably get the most robust code by not using untyped dictionaries.\n\nAs for this issue I'm going to close it since there's nothing actionable on our side as far as I can tell.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5816590784/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]